    "title": "Heads Up, Shreveport: Is Invest 93L Aiming for Us as a Tropical Storm? - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Shreveport\nHeads Up, Shreveport: Is Invest 93L Aiming for Us as a Tropical Storm?\nBy Evan Roberts,\n4 hours agoTropical storms and hurricanes are nothing new for Louisiana, but here in Shreveport, we often experience only a fraction of the intense weather they bring near the Gulf. Currently, a weather system is moving over the Gulf Coast and has a 40% chance of developing into a full-fledged tropical storm. If the system gets stronger, some meteorologists expect it to head straight for Shreveport.",
